# ── Sensitive config / secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local overrides — never commit these
**/appsettings.local.json
**/appsettings.local.*.json
**/appsettings.development.json
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/secrets.json
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# ── Visual Studio local state ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# .vs/ can contain Copilot chat history with secrets — never commit
**/.vs/
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# ── .NET / C# build artefacts ────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/bin/
**/obj/
*.user
*.nupkg
*.pdb
*.iobj
*.ipdb
*.ilk
*.meta
*_i.c
*_p.c
*_h.h
.nuget/
nupkg/

# ── User secrets (dotnet user-secrets) ───────────────────────────────────────
**/usersecrets/

# ── Node ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/node_modules/
**/package-lock.json

# ── IDE / editor ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# ── Runtime output ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log

# ── Copilot Orchestrator temporary files ─────────────────────────────────────
.orchestrator/
.worktrees/
